From c7b8e94323bca76936f0a8064e53c549c0ad5651 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 22:04:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] test(desktop): measure main-pane strip layout in Chromium
 [daveey]

Add required core E2E coverage using production ShellWorkspace, layout tree,
registry and CSS with visible fake sidebar/main/terminal pane content.
Measure absent, visible and null contributions and sidebar-hidden titlebar
clearance. The original jsdom tests checked structure, not real geometry.

Proof: Chromium passes. Source mutants fail: moving MainPaneTop to the shell
shifts sidebar y from 0 to 48 and height from 800 to 752; minHeight 24 fails
the null-height assertion. Renderer tsc passes; full scripts/check passes.
No production behavior change, plugin change, Mac update or restart.
